 session_notifications_readopt

The fresh origin/main merge pushed session_notifications.py to 2004 lines (cap 2000).
Move _readopted_exit_deliver, _wake_chat_for_readopted_exit and
_install_readopted_exit_waker unchanged into a bind_module sibling, registered from
session_notifications.register, so server._name lookups and monkeypatches still resolve.
